er  tarnished after the killing of Saudi  journalist Jamal keshavjee and the  kingdom's consulate in Istanbul the CIA  concluded that the crown prince must  have known about the operation if not  ordered it himself we know that he is  the the real power  there was some people calling him  anecdotally the Sun King the son of the  king but the person who is actually the  sovereign power in the Saudi state  reports suggest those detained now face  long-term imprisonment or even death  Alexei O'Brien al-jazeera
 

